claim.claim-text:
a topsheet;
a backsheet joined to the topsheet; and
an absorbent core positioned intermediate the topsheet and the backsheet, the absorbent core comprising a core absorbent material;
wherein the core absorbent material comprises superabsorbent polymers with a bio-based content from 5% to 100% using ASTM D6866-10, method B; and
wherein the absorbent article comprises a polyolefin content of at least 90% by weight, based on a total weight of the absorbent article excluding the core absorbent material.

the topsheet comprises a nonwoven topsheet;
the backsheet comprises one or more of a backsheet film or a backsheet nonwoven web; and
the absorbent article further comprises one or more of a landing zone, a stretch ear film, a back ear nonwoven web, tape tabs, ear hooks, a front ear nonwoven web, a waist feature nonwoven web, waist feature elastics, a barrier leg cuff nonwoven web, outer leg elastics, an acquisition material, a core cover nonwoven web, chassis adhesives, or core adhesives;
wherein at least one of the nonwoven topsheet, the backsheet film, the backsheet nonwoven web, the landing zone, the stretch ear film, the back ear nonwoven web, the tape tabs, the ear hooks, the front ear nonwoven web, the waist feature nonwoven web, the waist feature elastics, the barrier leg cuff nonwoven web, the outer leg elastics, the acquisition material, the core cover nonwoven web, the chassis adhesives, or the core adhesives comprises a bio-based polyolefin with a bio-based content from 5% to 100% using ASTM D6866-10, method B.
